25203.description:
Digital Media Operator (1–2 people)
We are looking for a creative and passionate digital media operator responsible for managing Baosen’s short video content and operations on platforms such as WeChat Video Channel, TikTok, Twitter, and Facebook, linkedin.
Job Responsibilities:
Plan, shoot, edit, and publish high-quality short videos to enhance brand influence;
Develop content strategies based on different platform features to attract target audiences;
Regularly analyze video data, optimize content direction, and improve account exposure and  interaction with followers;
Follow digital media trends, find hot topics, and keep content creative and attractive;
Work with the team to complete other tasks related to digital media operations.
Job Requirements:
Bachelor’s degree or above, major in digital media preferred;
Sharp sense of media trends, able to quickly capture hot topics and turn them into quality content;
Skilled in short video shooting and editing, able to handle the full process from planning to publishing;
Having successful social media account operation cases is preferred;
Good communication and teamwork skills, strong sense of responsibility, and excellent execution ability.
