25196.description:
Senior Apartment and Shop Salesperson (1–2 people)
Job Requirements:
Positive, enthusiastic, and in agreement with the company culture;
Diploma or above, with a hardworking attitude;
Strong customer communication and development skills;
Experience in selling apartments or shops;
Having own customer resources or channels, basic Chinese skills, and familiarity with the full real estate transaction process and industry knowledge are preferred.
Main Responsibilities:
1. Customer Maintenance
(1) Responsible for customer reception and consultation, providing professional real estate services;
(2) Accompany customers to view properties, promote transactions, and follow up on service;
(3) Maintain customer records, analyze client information, and establish customer files;
(4) Assist with client reservation, contract signing, and payment collection, and maintain good relationships with property owners;
(5) Assist in handling and reporting customer complaints.
2. Sales Target Achievement
(1) Follow team leaders’ instructions, complete assigned tasks on time, and strive to meet and exceed company sales targets.
